This file gives the details of Denali models used in the tb_Denali.vhd and tb_Denal1.vhd for
the verification od SMC (PL092). The tb_Denali has to be run with
DenaliTests,Cornercase1,Cornercase2,BROMBusyInsertion tests in the bustest directory.The tb_Denali1.vhd has to be run with BROMDelayTest.c
The following are the memory models used in tb_Denali.vhd.

